<meta name='title' content="2JVX zinc site: NEMO zinc finger"/>
<meta name='description' content="NMR, 10 models. Model 1 as deposited. One unit is one angstrom. A bond to zinc glows only while it measures under 2.5 angstrom. Materials, lights, radii and the cage faces are look, not data."/>
